  "title": "Convening of the Annual Shareholders’ Meeting on May 29, 2026",
  "summary": "Paris, March 18, 2026 – The Board of Directors of TotalEnergies SE met on March 18, 2026 under the chairmanship of Mr. Patrick Pouyanné, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer. It has decided to convene the Ordinary and Extraordinary Shareholders’ Meeting of the Corporation on Friday, May 29, 2026. The Notice of Meeting will be published […]",
